 Keys on the list
   k/up           move up
   j/down         move down
   pgup/ctrl+u    page up
   pgdown/ctrl+d  page down
   g/home         go to the top
   G/end          go to the bottom
   enter          open the conversation
   esc            back
   /              filter
   tab            show needs you, running, done or all
   n              new conversation
   a              attach to the agent
   w              watch the agent (read-only)
   o              open in the browser
   T              take it back from the terminal driving it
   ?              help
   q              quit

 While typing a filter (/)
   esc    back
   enter  keep the filter
 esc back  q quit